  1: ---
  2: layout: default
  3: title: Plugin buildroot_lock
  4: ---
  5: 
  6: buildroot_lock Plugin
  7: =====================
  8: 
  9: This plugin generates an additional build artifact—the buildroot *lockfile*
  10: (`buildroot_lock.json` file in the result directory).
  11: 
  12: The *lockfile* describes both the list of buildroot sources (e.g., a list of
  13: installed RPMs, bootstrap image info, etc.) and a set of Mock configuration
  14: options.  Using this information, Mock can later reproduce the buildroot
  15: preparation (see the [Hermetic Builds feature page](feature-hermetic-builds)).
  16: 
  17: This plugin is **disabled** by default but is automatically enabled with the
  18: `--calculate-build-dependencies` option.  You can enable it (for all builds) by
  19: this configuration snippet:
  20: 
  21: ```python
  22: config_opts['plugin_conf']['buildroot_lock_enable'] = True
  23: ```
  24: 
  25: **Note:** This plugin does not work with the `--offline` option.
  26: 
  27: 
  28: Format of the *buildroot_lock.json* file
  29: ----------------------------------------
  30: 
  31: The file `buildroot_lock.json` is a JSON file.  List of JSON Schema files is
  32: installed together with the Mock RPM package:
  33: 
  34:     rpm -ql mock | grep schema
  35:     /usr/share/doc/mock/buildroot-lock-schema-1.0.0.json
  36:     /usr/share/doc/mock/buildroot-lock-schema-1.1.0.json
  37: 
  38: Currently, we do not provide a compatibility promise.  Only the exact same
  39: version of Mock that produced the file is guaranteed to read and process it.
  40: For more information, see [Hermetic Builds](feature-hermetic-builds).
  41: 
  42: Also, in the future we plan to switch to a standardized tooling so we operate
  43: with a standardized format, too.  For more info see the [DNF5 feature
  44: request][discussion], [rpm-lockfile-prototype][] and [libpkgmanifest][].
  45: 
  46: [discussion]: https://github.com/rpm-software-management/dnf5/issues/833
  47: [rpm-lockfile-prototype]: https://github.com/konflux-ci/rpm-lockfile-prototype
  48: [libpkgmanifest]: https://github.com/rpm-software-management/libpkgmanifest
